1
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:11,399
THE ARTIST JOHAN BORG

2
00:00:11,475 --> 00:00:13,966
DISAPPEARED SOME YEARS AGO

3
00:00:14,045 --> 00:00:16,707
WITHOUT A TRACE , FROM HIS HOME

4
00:00:16,781 --> 00:00:19,113
ON THE ISLAND OF BALTRUM

5
00:00:19,183 --> 00:00:21,344
IN THE FRISIAN ISLANDS .

6
00:00:21,419 --> 00:00:23,751
HIS WIFE ALMA

7
00:00:23,821 --> 00:00:26,654
LATER LEFT ME JOHAN 'S DIARY ,

8
00:00:26,724 --> 00:00:29,215
WHICH SHE HAD FOUND

9
00:00:29,293 --> 00:00:31,784
AMONG HIS PAPERS .

10
00:00:31,862 --> 00:00:35,593
THIS DIARY AND ALMA 'S ACCOUNT ARE THE BASIS OF THIS FILM .

11
00:00:35,666 --> 00:00:38,430
Can someone move that chair ?

12
00:00:38,502 --> 00:00:39,943
And lower that a little ...

13
00:00:40,043 --> 00:00:41,832
HOUR OF THE WOLF

14
00:00:42,051 --> 00:00:44,608
A FILM BY INGMAR BERGMAN

15
00:00:47,678 --> 00:00:49,339
Have you been ...

16
00:01:16,173 --> 00:01:18,198
Listen , we 're not quite finished yet .

17
00:01:18,276 --> 00:01:19,868
No ? All right .

18
00:01:38,429 --> 00:01:40,260
Quiet , all ! Rolling !

19
00:01:40,331 --> 00:01:41,481
Take !

20
00:01:46,370 --> 00:01:47,530
Camera !

21
00:01:48,839 --> 00:01:50,136
And begin .

22
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:31,142
No ...

23
00:02:32,483 --> 00:02:34,474
I have nothing more to tell .

24
00:02:39,290 --> 00:02:41,622
I 've given you the diary .

25
00:02:45,429 --> 00:02:48,330
And you wonder why I choose to stay on here ?

26
00:02:50,034 --> 00:02:53,435
We 've lived in this house together almost seven years .

27
00:02:55,740 --> 00:02:58,265
Come winter , I can move to the mainland ,

28
00:02:58,342 --> 00:03:01,368
work at the store as I have done before

29
00:03:01,445 --> 00:03:03,504
when money was short .

30
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:12,787
The baby is due in a month , the doctor has said .

31
00:03:13,924 --> 00:03:15,414
He examined me in May ,

32
00:03:15,493 --> 00:03:17,984
before the very last time we came out here .

33
00:03:22,166 --> 00:03:24,361
It was on a Friday , I remember .

34
00:03:25,536 --> 00:03:27,561
It was quite late ...

35
00:03:27,638 --> 00:03:29,503
about 10 : 00 , I think .

36
00:03:31,208 --> 00:03:33,335
But it was still light out .

37
00:03:38,282 --> 00:03:41,581
We 'd planned to stay here until August .

38
00:03:43,654 --> 00:03:46,122
We were going to be completely alone .

39
00:03:48,159 --> 00:03:50,559
He didn 't want to see another human being here .

40
00:03:50,628 --> 00:03:52,118
He was afraid .

41
00:04:03,340 --> 00:04:06,207
He liked that I was quiet .

42
00:04:08,546 --> 00:04:09,945
He liked ...

43
00:04:18,422 --> 00:04:21,880
We got here at about 3 : 00 in the morning .

44
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:25,087
We found a wheelbarrow in a shed on the beach .

45
00:04:28,199 --> 00:04:33,193
When we got here , we were happy to see the apple tree in blossom .

46
00:04:34,271 --> 00:04:36,967
Then we discovered footprints

47
00:04:37,041 --> 00:04:39,202
under the kitchen window in the flower bed .

48
00:04:39,276 --> 00:04:41,744
It annoyed Johan ,

49
00:04:41,812 --> 00:04:44,280
but we forgot about it , because ...

50
00:04:51,555 --> 00:04:53,113
Yes , we were happy .

51
00:04:54,925 --> 00:04:57,587
We were happy to be home in our own house again .

52
00:05:00,598 --> 00:05:02,862
Johan was uneasy .

53
00:05:02,933 --> 00:05:05,902
He always grew anxious when his work did not go well ,

54
00:05:05,970 --> 00:05:08,461
and it had not gone well for some time now .

55
00:05:11,242 --> 00:05:13,506
And he became sleepless .

56
00:05:14,879 --> 00:05:18,474
He was frightened , as if he was afraid of the dark .

57
00:05:22,319 --> 00:05:25,083
It had gotten worse in the last few years .

58
00:08:39,249 --> 00:08:41,240
- I know what . - What ?

59
00:08:41,318 --> 00:08:43,309
- I 'm going to draw you . - No !

60
00:08:43,387 --> 00:08:44,547
- Yes ! - Oh , no .

61
00:08:44,621 --> 00:08:45,918
- Please let me ! - No .

62
00:08:45,989 --> 00:08:47,854
- Yes , if you sit over there . - No .

63
00:08:47,925 --> 00:08:50,189
Oh , come on now . Go on , Fatso !

64
00:08:52,763 --> 00:08:56,028
- Here ? - A little farther back ... there .

65
00:08:57,668 --> 00:08:59,465
- Are you cold ? - No .

66
00:08:59,536 --> 00:09:00,867
I knew that .

67
00:09:00,938 --> 00:09:02,997
So sit , just sit like you always do .

68
00:09:03,073 --> 00:09:04,665
Don 't straighten up .

69
00:09:04,742 --> 00:09:07,643
And pull the coat down a little over your shoulder ...

70
00:09:09,947 --> 00:09:12,575
just like that , and pull your hair up

71
00:09:12,649 --> 00:09:14,981
so I can see your neck better .

72
00:09:16,353 --> 00:09:19,811
Fine , that 's right . And where are my glasses ?

73
00:09:19,890 --> 00:09:23,792
And the damned bow is broken again .

74
00:09:24,728 --> 00:09:26,992
There , can you sit just like that a moment ?

75
00:09:34,171 --> 00:09:36,503
If day after day ,

76
00:09:36,573 --> 00:09:39,041
I patiently drew you ...

77
00:09:43,914 --> 00:09:45,245
Hello !

78
00:11:16,173 --> 00:11:17,640
Now , look ...

79
00:11:20,177 --> 00:11:22,168
I haven 't shown these to anyone .

80
00:11:22,246 --> 00:11:24,305
You see , I made sketches of them !

81
00:11:25,682 --> 00:11:27,843
This is the one who turns up most often .

82
00:11:27,918 --> 00:11:29,909
And he 's almost harmless .

83
00:11:31,088 --> 00:11:32,988
I think he 's homosexual .

84
00:11:35,959 --> 00:11:38,018
And then there 's the old lady ,

85
00:11:38,095 --> 00:11:40,655
the one always threatening to take off her hat .

86
00:11:40,731 --> 00:11:42,756
Do you know what happens if she does ?

87
00:11:43,533 --> 00:11:45,933
Her face comes off along with it , you see .

88
00:11:49,573 --> 00:11:50,904
And here ...

89
00:11:52,075 --> 00:11:54,066
He 's the worst of the lot .

90
00:11:54,778 --> 00:11:56,769
I call him the Bird Man .

91
00:11:57,547 --> 00:12:01,313
I don 't know if it 's a real beak or only a mask .

92
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:05,384
He 's so strangely quick ...

93
00:12:06,657 --> 00:12:09,751
and he 's related to Papageno of The Magic Flute .

94
00:12:12,896 --> 00:12:14,386
And the others !

95
00:12:14,464 --> 00:12:17,524
The meat-eaters , the insects ...

96
00:12:19,036 --> 00:12:21,027
and especially the spider men .

97
00:12:21,705 --> 00:12:26,142
Here , the schoolmaster , his pointer in his trousers .

98
00:12:29,613 --> 00:12:34,846
And then all the cast-iron , cackling women .

99
00:12:38,789 --> 00:12:40,848
You must stay awake a little while longer .

100
00:12:53,170 --> 00:12:55,365
In just an hour or so it will be dawn ...

101
00:12:58,575 --> 00:13:00,065
and then I can sleep .

102
00:13:28,605 --> 00:13:31,267
A minute is actually an immense space of time .

103
00:13:32,642 --> 00:13:34,337
Wait , here it starts .

104
00:13:43,186 --> 00:13:44,585
Ten seconds .

105
00:13:58,068 --> 00:13:59,763
These seconds ...

106
00:14:02,506 --> 00:14:04,497
You see how long they last ?

107
00:14:12,015 --> 00:14:14,006
The minute isn 't over yet !

108
00:14:33,203 --> 00:14:34,761
Ah , finally .

109
00:14:36,106 --> 00:14:37,596
It 's gone now .

110
00:14:46,283 --> 00:14:47,978
Say something .

111
00:14:49,119 --> 00:14:50,848
Talk to me , Alma .

112
00:14:55,892 --> 00:14:57,052
Hey , you ...

113
00:14:58,261 --> 00:15:01,059
there 's something I 've thought about for a long time .

114
00:15:02,833 --> 00:15:04,391
Are you listening ?

115
00:15:09,106 --> 00:15:12,507
We 've lived together for seven years now ...

116
00:15:13,510 --> 00:15:15,705
No , that 's not what I was going to say .

117
00:15:15,779 --> 00:15:17,303
Now I know .

118
00:15:18,815 --> 00:15:23,218
Isn 't it true that old people who have lived a lifetime together

119
00:15:23,286 --> 00:15:25,618
start to resemble each other ?

120
00:15:26,723 --> 00:15:28,714
They finally share so much ,

121
00:15:28,792 --> 00:15:35,220
their thoughts and their faces take on the same expression .

122
00:15:37,334 --> 00:15:39,325
Why do you think that is ?

123
00:15:44,674 --> 00:15:49,008
I hope we will get so old that we ...

124
00:15:49,713 --> 00:15:51,908
think each other 's thoughts ...

125
00:15:53,917 --> 00:15:56,545
and we get little , dried-up ,

126
00:15:56,620 --> 00:16:00,215
identical wrinkled faces .

127
00:16:01,858 --> 00:16:03,689
What do you think about that ?

128
00:16:06,363 --> 00:16:07,853
Are you sleeping ?

129
00:16:10,534 --> 00:16:13,230
Come now .

130
00:16:14,171 --> 00:16:17,106
Let 's go to bed now .

131
00:16:17,174 --> 00:16:19,972
Okay .

132
00:17:46,329 --> 00:17:49,196
Don 't look so frightened , child .

133
00:17:49,266 --> 00:17:51,131
I 'm not dangerous .

134
00:17:52,235 --> 00:17:54,032
Give me your hand .

135
00:17:54,104 --> 00:17:56,072
Well ?

136
00:17:56,139 --> 00:17:58,437
Can you feel my hand now ?

137
00:17:59,142 --> 00:18:00,939
My fingers ,

138
00:18:01,011 --> 00:18:03,343
the veins under my skin ?

139
00:18:04,147 --> 00:18:07,310
At my age , the hands can get a little cold .

140
00:18:07,951 --> 00:18:11,352
I am , after all , 216 years old .

141
00:18:11,821 --> 00:18:14,551
No , what am I saying ?

142
00:18:14,624 --> 00:18:17,354
Seventy-six , I mean .

143
00:18:20,196 --> 00:18:24,257
No , I had better be on my way now .

144
00:18:24,334 --> 00:18:28,361
Now , what was it I was going to say ?

145
00:18:28,438 --> 00:18:31,601
Now I remember .

146
00:18:31,675 --> 00:18:35,509
In his black satchel under the bed ,

147
00:18:35,578 --> 00:18:43,451
there 's the sketchbook with drawings ...

148
00:18:43,520 --> 00:18:47,650
Tell him not to do that .

149
00:18:48,792 --> 00:18:50,817
And then one more thing .

150
00:18:50,894 --> 00:18:54,421
He hides his diary in the same satchel .

151
00:18:54,497 --> 00:18:56,294
Read it !

152
00:18:59,569 --> 00:19:02,037
No , no !

153
00:20:25,855 --> 00:20:29,256
DIARY

154
00:20:41,805 --> 00:20:43,932
Wednesday , July 22nd .

155
00:20:44,007 --> 00:20:46,066
I have recently been ill .

156
00:20:46,142 --> 00:20:49,475
Not seriously , but unpleasant enough .

157
00:21:26,382 --> 00:21:29,044
Pardon the interruption , but I have pondered for days

158
00:21:29,118 --> 00:21:31,951
how most appropriately I might approach you .

159
00:21:32,021 --> 00:21:34,489
I deemed it most polite to get directly to the point .

160
00:21:34,557 --> 00:21:37,390
My name is Von Merkens , Baron Von Merkens .

161
00:21:37,460 --> 00:21:38,620
Borg .

162
00:21:38,695 --> 00:21:41,255
As you may know , I own this island .

163
00:21:41,331 --> 00:21:43,731
I live in the old castle on the north side .

164
00:21:44,901 --> 00:21:47,062
Would you and your wife care to join us

165
00:21:47,136 --> 00:21:49,434
for a simple family supper ?

166
00:21:49,506 --> 00:21:50,973
That 's kind of you .

167
00:21:51,040 --> 00:21:54,669
It will be very simple , but I 'll give you a good wine .

168
00:21:54,744 --> 00:21:57,076
And our salmon fishing is renowned .

169
00:22:00,183 --> 00:22:01,377
Good-bye .

170
00:22:03,119 --> 00:22:05,519
I should also say that my wife and I

171
00:22:05,588 --> 00:22:10,218
are among your admirers , your ... fondest admirers .

172
00:22:32,282 --> 00:22:34,807
Thursday , July 27th .

173
00:22:35,385 --> 00:22:37,876
A very warm , hazy day .

174
00:22:38,888 --> 00:22:41,721
I am still sickly after my illness .

175
00:23:52,528 --> 00:23:54,519
Do you see this mark ?

176
00:23:55,798 --> 00:23:58,460
Be more careful , my love ,

177
00:23:58,534 --> 00:24:00,968
or it will end in disaster .

178
00:24:01,671 --> 00:24:04,333
Don 't you remember ? I was leaving for a party ,

179
00:24:04,407 --> 00:24:06,739
and I was wearing my green brocade dress .

180
00:24:06,809 --> 00:24:10,609
Afterwards , I had such trouble putting my hair up again !

181
00:24:10,680 --> 00:24:12,944
And then I forgot my gloves .

182
00:24:15,785 --> 00:24:18,515
I have something I must speak to you about .

183
00:24:21,157 --> 00:24:23,648
I 've received a letter that I must show you .

184
00:24:24,427 --> 00:24:26,725
It was sent yesterday .

185
00:24:26,796 --> 00:24:28,354
And here is what it says ...

186
00:24:29,632 --> 00:24:33,329
" You do not see us , but we see you .

187
00:24:33,403 --> 00:24:36,201
" The most horrible things can happen .

188
00:24:36,272 --> 00:24:39,639
" Dreams can become unveiled .

189
00:24:39,709 --> 00:24:41,802
The end is near ... "

190
00:24:43,079 --> 00:24:45,570
" The wells will run dry ,

191
00:24:45,648 --> 00:24:49,675
" and other fluids will moisten your white loins .

192
00:24:49,752 --> 00:24:51,743
Thus is it decided . "

193
00:24:54,424 --> 00:24:57,188
I almost became ill reading it .

194
00:25:00,663 --> 00:25:03,131
How hot your hands are .

195
00:25:03,199 --> 00:25:05,190
Do you have a fever ?

196
00:25:09,939 --> 00:25:12,703
Before I see you , I always get so wound up .

197
00:25:12,775 --> 00:25:14,766
Can you understand that ?

198
00:25:16,012 --> 00:25:19,743
I wander as if in a dream the whole afternoon .

199
00:25:20,550 --> 00:25:24,680
All my chores become so unreal and meaningless .

200
00:25:30,159 --> 00:25:32,787
Be so kind as to help me with the zipper in my dress .

201
00:25:32,862 --> 00:25:34,853
It always gets caught .

202
00:26:27,049 --> 00:26:31,782
A strong wind indeed ! But magnificent , is it not ?

203
00:26:31,854 --> 00:26:35,722
This place must be a painter 's dream or what ?

204
00:26:35,792 --> 00:26:38,192
I 've lived here for quite a while .

205
00:26:38,261 --> 00:26:40,889
One returns to the scene of the crime , so to speak ,

206
00:26:40,963 --> 00:26:42,726
and commits new crimes !

207
00:26:43,432 --> 00:26:46,060
You appear to be tired . Don 't over-exert yourself .

208
00:26:46,135 --> 00:26:49,161
I mean , at our age , a certain caution is to be advised .

209
00:26:49,238 --> 00:26:52,105
Youth is of tougher mettle .

210
00:26:52,175 --> 00:26:54,006
I happen to know .

211
00:26:54,076 --> 00:26:57,170
My name is Heerbrand , psychiatric curator .

212
00:26:57,246 --> 00:26:59,874
I finger people 's souls and turn their insides out .

213
00:26:59,949 --> 00:27:02,816
What do we see then ? I hardly need to tell you .

214
00:27:02,885 --> 00:27:05,513
As an artist , you know the human heart .

215
00:27:05,588 --> 00:27:07,579
What don 't you see in your facial studies ,

216
00:27:07,657 --> 00:27:09,887
not to mention in your self-portraits ?

217
00:27:10,393 --> 00:27:12,725
Why do you look at me like that ? Did I anger you ?

218
00:27:12,795 --> 00:27:15,992
Your nerves out of sorts ? Something plaguing you ?

219
00:27:17,533 --> 00:27:18,683
Shut up !

220
00:27:18,801 --> 00:27:20,268
Shut up !

221
00:28:33,276 --> 00:28:35,506
I think I need to ask you for more money .

222
00:28:35,578 --> 00:28:38,069
What you gave me this month is almost gone .

223
00:28:38,147 --> 00:28:41,810
We must pay the store next time we go to the mainland .

224
00:28:42,485 --> 00:28:47,855
The bill is 176.50 , and then there 's the milk .

225
00:28:49,292 --> 00:28:51,692
Don 't just shovel over money like that .

226
00:28:51,761 --> 00:28:54,355
You have to look at my accounting !

227
00:28:54,430 --> 00:28:57,661
It 's quite important , at least to me .

228
00:28:57,733 --> 00:29:01,225
I received 500 on the 3rd .

229
00:29:01,304 --> 00:29:05,104
You bought me that blanket , rather expensive ... 35 .

230
00:29:06,175 --> 00:29:08,837
But it 's warm and lovely when I lie alone .

231
00:29:09,478 --> 00:29:11,878
And here 's the previous bill from the store .

232
00:29:11,948 --> 00:29:15,475
It 's high because we had to buy flour , sugar , and canned goods .

233
00:29:15,551 --> 00:29:19,248
Comes to over 200 kronor ... 219 .

234
00:29:22,458 --> 00:29:25,518
And there 's pocket money and stamps

235
00:29:25,594 --> 00:29:27,585
and a chain for my bicycle

236
00:29:27,663 --> 00:29:29,824
and new radio batteries ...

237
00:29:30,933 --> 00:29:32,924
and the potato peeler ...

238
00:29:35,771 --> 00:29:39,969
then soap , washing powder , a nail brush .

239
00:29:40,042 --> 00:29:43,500
You need a new toothbrush . The one you have looks horrible .

240
00:29:43,579 --> 00:29:45,672
- No . - Well , it does .

241
00:29:50,019 --> 00:29:53,284
Then 50 kronor for your boy 's birthday .

242
00:29:53,356 --> 00:29:55,347
And postage ... 75 öre .

243
00:29:55,424 --> 00:29:58,052
That 's about 500 kronor .

244
00:29:58,127 --> 00:30:00,755
7,36 .

245
00:30:04,734 --> 00:30:07,225
You can count it to be sure .

246
00:30:22,051 --> 00:30:24,144
We 're invited to the castle on Friday .

247
00:30:24,220 --> 00:30:25,653
I know .

248
00:30:28,791 --> 00:30:30,452
How do you know that ?

249
00:30:36,165 --> 00:30:38,099
Good evening .

250
00:30:38,167 --> 00:30:40,533
My wife Corinne .

251
00:30:40,603 --> 00:30:42,662
You 're very welcome . Welcome .

252
00:30:42,738 --> 00:30:45,229
My mother Countess Von Merkens .

253
00:30:46,675 --> 00:30:48,666
My brother Ernst .

254
00:30:49,745 --> 00:30:51,838
A pleasure . A pleasure .

255
00:30:51,914 --> 00:30:54,576
Here is Archivist Lindhorst .

256
00:30:55,217 --> 00:30:57,947
Delighted . I am one of your fondest admirers .

257
00:30:58,020 --> 00:31:00,352
And this is Curator Heerbrand .

258
00:31:00,423 --> 00:31:03,051
A pleasure . I believe we 've met already .

259
00:31:03,125 --> 00:31:04,956
Would you like a drink ?

260
00:31:09,832 --> 00:31:13,359
- May I serve a little ... - Yes , by all means .

261
00:31:14,170 --> 00:31:16,968
The summer heat makes you so thirsty .

262
00:31:17,039 --> 00:31:19,940
So how long have you been there ?

263
00:31:22,845 --> 00:31:24,972
I thought you had been living here for months ,

264
00:31:25,047 --> 00:31:27,777
we 've been hearing about you for so long !

265
00:31:27,850 --> 00:31:32,810
Time flies so quickly ! Delighted you could come .

266
00:31:39,161 --> 00:31:42,619
Damned awful housemaid . But she 's cheap , of course .

267
00:31:42,698 --> 00:31:44,757
My brother cannot afford better .

268
00:31:44,834 --> 00:31:47,564
I would like you all to observe that the reason the soup ...

269
00:31:47,636 --> 00:31:50,537
We live in one place now . We used to travel a lot .

270
00:31:50,606 --> 00:31:54,838
Do you enjoy travel ? Nothing is as stimulating .

271
00:31:54,910 --> 00:31:57,003
Alma is an unusual and beautiful name .

272
00:31:57,079 --> 00:31:59,707
I 'm completely incapable of feeling aggression .

273
00:31:59,782 --> 00:32:01,773
I can muster bureaucratic vengefulness ...

274
00:32:01,851 --> 00:32:06,185
Here , we 're used to humiliation . We find it pleasurable ...

275
00:32:06,255 --> 00:32:07,916
our fangs have remained intact .

276
00:32:07,990 --> 00:32:10,083
Nowadays I want to be loved .

277
00:32:10,159 --> 00:32:13,856
I once bought a painting from a well-known artist .

278
00:32:13,929 --> 00:32:15,260
No comments now , Ernst !

279
00:32:15,331 --> 00:32:17,322
Then I hung it upside down in my salon

280
00:32:17,399 --> 00:32:19,993
and invited the artist over , along with a lot of people

281
00:32:20,069 --> 00:32:22,060
who appreciated a good joke !

282
00:32:22,138 --> 00:32:25,539
What a laugh we had then ! My God , how we laughed .

283
00:32:25,608 --> 00:32:28,202
What do you say , sir Artist ? Wasn 't that a fine joke ?

284
00:32:29,078 --> 00:32:33,242
The sores never heal , the pus never ceases to flow .

285
00:32:33,315 --> 00:32:38,275
The infection is constant ... worse , faster , or slower towards the end .

286
00:32:38,354 --> 00:32:41,050
The resistance of the heart decides the outcome .

287
00:32:41,123 --> 00:32:42,784
I am constantly losing weight .

288
00:32:42,858 --> 00:32:45,986
I travel the world over consulting specialists .

289
00:32:46,061 --> 00:32:48,052
Sometimes the loss just stops ,

290
00:32:48,130 --> 00:32:50,894
as it did this summer , but then it starts again .

291
00:32:50,966 --> 00:32:53,059
My husband says it 's psychological ,

292
00:32:53,135 --> 00:32:55,262
that it all began when we lost our money .

293
00:32:55,337 --> 00:32:57,396
I embezzled the family fortune !

294
00:32:57,473 --> 00:33:00,909
- I am the guilty one ! - We 've heard this ...

295
00:33:00,976 --> 00:33:03,672
Why is Lindhorst sitting at our table ?

296
00:33:03,746 --> 00:33:05,611
Can 't we just sell and leave ?

297
00:33:05,681 --> 00:33:08,741
My fault , my fault , all this suffering .

298
00:33:08,817 --> 00:33:10,148
My fault !

299
00:33:10,219 --> 00:33:14,315
And then I shouted , " To hell with your medicines !

300
00:33:14,390 --> 00:33:17,450
" It won 't go away . It will never go away !

301
00:33:17,526 --> 00:33:21,257
" You must operate it away . You must just slice it off !

302
00:33:21,330 --> 00:33:24,925
I am an old hag . There must be a limit ! "

303
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:28,436
And then he laughed and said ,

304
00:33:28,504 --> 00:33:30,233
" No , madame Countess ,

305
00:33:30,306 --> 00:33:33,798
I have never heard of any limits at all ! "

306
00:33:36,145 --> 00:33:38,306
Yes , we have children , two boys .

307
00:33:38,380 --> 00:33:41,975
Oh , no , not here . They live with an uncle ...

308
00:33:42,051 --> 00:33:44,645
whom I believe is an acquaintance ?

309
00:33:44,720 --> 00:33:46,711
I understand you know Veronica Vogler .

310
00:33:46,789 --> 00:33:49,314
And very well , after what I 've heard .

311
00:33:49,959 --> 00:33:51,893
An extraordinarily beautiful woman .

312
00:33:51,961 --> 00:33:53,622
Veronica Vogler is charming !

313
00:33:53,696 --> 00:33:56,494
Have you also met her ? Truly very charming .

314
00:33:56,565 --> 00:33:57,715
No ?

315
00:33:58,567 --> 00:34:00,865
Such hatred in those eyes !

316
00:34:07,643 --> 00:34:11,704
Fredrik , the cacti you planted need to go !

317
00:34:11,780 --> 00:34:14,374
I mean , I don 't enjoy them at all .

318
00:34:29,732 --> 00:34:31,996
Actually , I am allergic to them .

319
00:34:32,067 --> 00:34:35,002
You shouldn 't drag them along ...

320
00:34:43,045 --> 00:34:46,344
All right , then ! We shall take coffee in the library .

321
00:35:13,342 --> 00:35:14,775
- Help me a little . - Yes ...

322
00:35:37,733 --> 00:35:39,667
Ladies and gentlemen ! Your attention !

323
00:35:39,735 --> 00:35:43,466
May I offer a small puppet show to divert us ?

324
00:35:44,039 --> 00:35:46,030
Can we extinguish the lights ?

325
00:35:47,843 --> 00:35:49,242
There . Good .

326
00:35:49,311 --> 00:35:52,769
Our guests of honor .

327
00:35:53,349 --> 00:35:58,787
Come , come . There .

328
00:36:16,972 --> 00:36:18,166
Music .

329
00:37:57,239 --> 00:37:59,901
The Magic Flute is the greatest example .

330
00:37:59,975 --> 00:38:02,068
One moment . I shall prove this presently .

331
00:38:04,980 --> 00:38:08,313
Tamino 's guides have just left him in the dark courtyard

332
00:38:08,383 --> 00:38:10,715
outside the Temple of Wisdom .

333
00:38:10,786 --> 00:38:12,913
The young man cries in deepest despair ,

334
00:38:12,988 --> 00:38:16,856
" Oh , eternal night , when shalt thou pass ?

335
00:38:16,925 --> 00:38:21,021
When shall the light find my eyes ? "

336
00:38:22,297 --> 00:38:27,701
The fatally ill Mozart secretly empathizes with these words .

337
00:38:27,769 --> 00:38:30,932
And the reply from the chorus and orchestra is also ,

338
00:38:31,006 --> 00:38:33,406
" Soon , soon , youth ... "

339
00:38:34,243 --> 00:38:35,733
" or never . "

340
00:38:38,113 --> 00:38:39,603
The most beautiful ,

341
00:38:39,681 --> 00:38:44,584
the most shattering music ever written .

342
00:38:46,021 --> 00:38:48,319
Tamino asks ,

343
00:38:48,390 --> 00:38:50,415
" Is Pamina still alive ? "

344
00:38:51,527 --> 00:38:54,360
The invisible chorus answers ,

345
00:38:54,429 --> 00:38:57,364
" Pamina , Pamina is still alive . "

346
00:38:59,234 --> 00:39:00,895
Hear ...

347
00:39:00,969 --> 00:39:05,770
the strange and illogical but genial rhythm ...

348
00:39:07,242 --> 00:39:10,700
Pami ... Na .

349
00:39:16,218 --> 00:39:19,187
This is no longer the name of a young woman ...

350
00:39:20,422 --> 00:39:24,483
but an incantation , a sorcerer 's formula .

351
00:39:25,027 --> 00:39:28,622
A name text ... In short , a commission ...

352
00:39:29,398 --> 00:39:32,367
and yet the highest manifestation of art .

353
00:39:32,434 --> 00:39:34,664
Would you not agree , sir Artist ?

354
00:39:35,737 --> 00:39:37,227
Pardon me .

355
00:39:37,306 --> 00:39:40,639
I call myself " artist " for want of a better term .

356
00:39:40,709 --> 00:39:43,576
There is nothing self-evident in my creative work

357
00:39:43,645 --> 00:39:45,636
except the compulsion to do it .

358
00:39:45,714 --> 00:39:47,705
Through no intent of my own ,

359
00:39:47,783 --> 00:39:50,217
I have been pointed out as something apart ,

360
00:39:50,285 --> 00:39:52,480
a five-legged calf , a monster .

361
00:39:52,554 --> 00:39:54,545
I have never fought for that position ,

362
00:39:54,623 --> 00:39:57,615
nor do I do so now to keep it .

363
00:39:57,693 --> 00:39:59,388
Yet I may well at times

364
00:39:59,461 --> 00:40:02,624
have felt the winds of megalomania sweep across my brow .

365
00:40:02,698 --> 00:40:04,757
But I believe myself to be immune .

366
00:40:04,833 --> 00:40:06,994
I need only for one second remind myself

367
00:40:07,069 --> 00:40:10,732
of the utter unimportance of art in the human world

368
00:40:10,806 --> 00:40:13,138
in order to cool myself down again .

369
00:40:13,208 --> 00:40:16,109
But that does not mean the compulsion does not remain .

370
00:40:16,178 --> 00:40:18,772
- So speaks a true artist ! - This is a real confession .

371
00:40:18,847 --> 00:40:21,611
Magnificent ! What courage ! What clarity !

372
00:40:21,683 --> 00:40:23,844
I suggest we raise our glasses to our artist ...

373
00:40:23,919 --> 00:40:26,012
Not only a genius but a thinker , too !

374
00:40:26,088 --> 00:40:28,249
I 'll be damned . I never would have suspected .

375
00:40:28,323 --> 00:40:31,190
A flowering rose for your hair .

376
00:40:32,361 --> 00:40:35,057
I must have scratched your cheek with my fingernail .

377
00:40:35,130 --> 00:40:37,121
Let me see . I think it 's bleeding !

378
00:40:37,199 --> 00:40:40,635
My handkerchief ... No , it is clean .

379
00:40:40,702 --> 00:40:45,036
- Our artist is wounded . - I 'm so clumsy .

380
00:40:47,609 --> 00:40:50,772
Stay calm now . You 've had too much to drink .

381
00:40:50,846 --> 00:40:52,575
Come , stay by me for a little while now .

382
00:40:52,648 --> 00:40:55,481
He doesn 't sleep at night . That 's why he can handle so little .

383
00:40:55,550 --> 00:40:57,848
Come , let 's you and I get some fresh air .

384
00:41:01,690 --> 00:41:05,091
The core of the castle dates from the 14th century .

385
00:41:05,160 --> 00:41:07,890
It 's been in our family since the late 16th century .

386
00:41:07,963 --> 00:41:11,831
We got a little over-excited . We live in such isolation .

387
00:41:11,900 --> 00:41:14,960
We gave you a scare , but you won 't leave us now , will you ?

388
00:41:15,037 --> 00:41:18,234
See there , Corinne , our castle is rather beautiful at night .

389
00:41:18,306 --> 00:41:20,501
Yes , and that would be only at night .

390
00:41:21,376 --> 00:41:25,176
My garter ! Look away now , Mr. Heerbrand !

391
00:41:25,247 --> 00:41:27,738
- Where has Ernst gone ? - Ernst , friend , where are you ?

392
00:41:27,816 --> 00:41:29,807
I just went off on my own a bit .

393
00:41:29,885 --> 00:41:32,854
I 'm ashamed that the grounds are so unkempt .

394
00:41:32,921 --> 00:41:36,118
Imagine ten years ago ... A paragon of garden art .

395
00:41:36,191 --> 00:41:39,024
We never kiss . Have you thought of that ?

396
00:41:40,162 --> 00:41:42,494
I can almost count our kisses .

397
00:41:42,564 --> 00:41:45,727
There is something that frightens me almost to insanity .

398
00:41:45,801 --> 00:41:47,996
I meet an unknown man in the road .

399
00:41:48,070 --> 00:41:50,664
We converse .

400
00:41:50,739 --> 00:41:54,835
Suddenly he turns and lands a vicious blow on my cheek !

401
00:41:54,910 --> 00:41:59,040
His face is corpse white and his eyes are full of hatred .

402
00:41:59,114 --> 00:42:00,445
And I understand nothing !

403
00:42:00,515 --> 00:42:02,813
I only feel nauseated . My nose is bleeding ,

404
00:42:02,884 --> 00:42:07,014
I stammer some silly excuses , horribly shaken ,

405
00:42:07,089 --> 00:42:10,081
and I ask myself , when the man has disappeared ,

406
00:42:10,158 --> 00:42:13,093
" Is this how it is ? Is this how it must be ? "

407
00:42:13,161 --> 00:42:16,619
I can never forget the man 's eyes .

408
00:42:16,698 --> 00:42:19,258
- The worst thing was ... - Nothing to worry about .

409
00:42:19,334 --> 00:42:21,768
The blow , that blow ...

410
00:42:21,837 --> 00:42:25,329
The worst of all was the man 's eyes ...

411
00:42:26,374 --> 00:42:27,864
Are you leaving already ?

412
00:42:27,943 --> 00:42:30,070
No , before you leave you must see

413
00:42:30,145 --> 00:42:32,636
where I 've hung your painting of Veronica Vogler .

414
00:42:32,714 --> 00:42:34,545
Alma , dear , come along , too .

415
00:42:34,616 --> 00:42:36,675
She 's sleeping . We won 't disturb her .

416
00:42:36,752 --> 00:42:40,188
- I 'm not sleeping . - Of course we 'll go along .

417
00:42:40,255 --> 00:42:43,452
Come , then , both of you . Won 't take a moment .

418
00:42:44,092 --> 00:42:45,923
Alma , you are about to see

419
00:42:45,994 --> 00:42:48,485
something very beautiful your husband has made .

420
00:42:48,563 --> 00:42:50,861
Here is the painting ,

421
00:42:50,932 --> 00:42:52,923
directly in front of my bed .

422
00:42:53,001 --> 00:42:55,561
I can see it each morning and night .

423
00:42:56,104 --> 00:42:59,096
It has become like a part of my solitary life .

424
00:43:02,778 --> 00:43:04,336
I love her .

425
00:43:08,784 --> 00:43:11,048
How long did you live together ?

426
00:43:11,119 --> 00:43:13,553
Pardon my asking something so personal .

427
00:43:13,622 --> 00:43:16,216
- Five years . - Really ?

428
00:43:16,291 --> 00:43:18,020
So he 's told you ?

429
00:43:18,093 --> 00:43:20,687
He loved her , didn 't he ?

430
00:43:21,229 --> 00:43:23,254
I didn 't need to ask that .

431
00:43:24,299 --> 00:43:27,291
It was a first-class scandal at the time .

432
00:43:27,369 --> 00:43:29,530
But so romantic ...

433
00:43:30,839 --> 00:43:33,535
- Jealous ? - I don 't believe so .

434
00:43:33,608 --> 00:43:38,204
My husband is quite jealous . Well , he 's an excellent lover .

435
00:43:39,281 --> 00:43:41,476
Look at this mark , by the way .

436
00:43:42,317 --> 00:43:46,117
It 's a scar from another man 's , shall we say , advances ?

437
00:43:46,188 --> 00:43:48,850
A never-ending spring of renewed desire .

438
00:43:51,159 --> 00:43:55,459
It 's all very trivial , of course , but it 's stimulating for me .

439
00:43:55,530 --> 00:43:57,521
I need to come up with something new soon .

440
00:43:57,599 --> 00:44:00,864
That mark can 't evoke fascinated admiration forever .

441
00:44:00,936 --> 00:44:02,733
Can you help me ?

442
00:44:02,804 --> 00:44:05,102
Alma , little dear , don 't get angry .

443
00:44:05,173 --> 00:44:09,542
It was only in jest , of course , but it was a stupid joke .

444
00:44:09,611 --> 00:44:11,772
Come , let 's go down to the others .

445
00:44:17,052 --> 00:44:21,113
I have , in any case , bought a considerable piece of your husband ...

446
00:44:22,624 --> 00:44:24,114
have I not ?

447
00:44:45,881 --> 00:44:48,475
I have to confess that I have read your diary .

448
00:44:48,550 --> 00:44:51,178
It makes me sick with fear !

449
00:44:51,253 --> 00:44:53,551
Wait . Hear me out .

450
00:44:53,622 --> 00:44:56,557
I need to tell you what I 've been thinking these past few days .

451
00:44:56,625 --> 00:44:58,456
Here 's what I 've been thinking .

452
00:44:58,526 --> 00:45:01,552
I see that something is going to happen , something evil ,

453
00:45:01,630 --> 00:45:04,599
but I don 't know what to call it .

454
00:45:04,666 --> 00:45:07,499
But if you think I 'm going to run away , I won 't !

455
00:45:07,569 --> 00:45:10,970
I won 't run away no matter how frightened I am !

456
00:45:12,507 --> 00:45:14,372
And one more thing .

457
00:45:14,442 --> 00:45:18,037
They 're trying to separate us . They want you for themselves .

458
00:45:18,113 --> 00:45:20,775
As long as I 'm with you , it 's much harder for them .

459
00:45:24,286 --> 00:45:27,949
I won 't run away , no matter how much they try !

460
00:45:28,623 --> 00:45:31,490
I 'll stay right where I am !

461
00:45:32,627 --> 00:45:34,857
Johan , answer me !

462
00:47:09,224 --> 00:47:13,354
- Do you hear how quiet it is ? - Yes , it is quiet .

463
00:47:19,034 --> 00:47:22,299
There was a time when nights were for sleep ...

464
00:47:24,339 --> 00:47:26,603
deep , dreamless sleep .

465
00:47:27,542 --> 00:47:29,305
I cannot sleep .

466
00:47:30,278 --> 00:47:32,269
I wake out of fear .

467
00:47:38,053 --> 00:47:42,387
- Are you tired ? - No , not so terribly .

468
00:47:42,457 --> 00:47:45,790
I have held vigil each night until daylight .

469
00:47:48,930 --> 00:47:50,921
But this is the worst hour .

470
00:47:54,469 --> 00:47:56,767
- Do you know what it 's called ? - No .

471
00:47:57,372 --> 00:48:00,034
The old people used to call it the " Hour of the Wolf . "

472
00:48:01,176 --> 00:48:04,168
It 's the hour at which most people die

473
00:48:04,245 --> 00:48:06,236
and most children are born .

474
00:48:07,015 --> 00:48:09,142
It 's now that the nightmares come to us .

475
00:48:10,985 --> 00:48:13,818
- And if we are awake ... - We are afraid .

476
00:48:14,923 --> 00:48:16,390
We are afraid .

477
00:48:22,564 --> 00:48:23,861
What is it ?

478
00:48:24,499 --> 00:48:27,832
Nothing . I just thought of something from my childhood .

479
00:48:30,839 --> 00:48:33,171
It was some sort of punishment .

480
00:48:33,975 --> 00:48:36,170
They threw me into a closet .

481
00:48:36,945 --> 00:48:38,503
They shut the door .

482
00:48:39,247 --> 00:48:41,238
It got quiet and dark .

483
00:48:41,983 --> 00:48:44,178
I was horribly scared .

484
00:48:44,252 --> 00:48:46,379
I kicked and pounded ,

485
00:48:46,454 --> 00:48:51,221
because they had told me that a little person lived in that closet ...

486
00:48:52,827 --> 00:48:57,196
who gnawed the toes off naughty children !

487
00:48:58,700 --> 00:49:03,569
When I stopped pounding , I heard something rattling ,

488
00:49:03,638 --> 00:49:06,505
and I knew my hour had come .

489
00:49:06,574 --> 00:49:10,670
And in a kind of ... silent panic ,

490
00:49:10,745 --> 00:49:14,374
I climbed onto some shelves

491
00:49:14,449 --> 00:49:17,509
and tried to heave myself up by my hands .

492
00:49:17,585 --> 00:49:19,644
Clothes tumbled around me .

493
00:49:19,721 --> 00:49:22,053
I lost my grip and fell .

494
00:49:22,123 --> 00:49:24,387
I swung my fists through the air

495
00:49:24,459 --> 00:49:27,553
to shield myself from that little creature .

496
00:49:27,629 --> 00:49:31,759
All the while I wailed in fear

497
00:49:31,833 --> 00:49:33,824
and begged to be forgiven .

498
00:49:35,103 --> 00:49:40,040
Finally the door opened and they let me step out into the daylight .

499
00:49:42,410 --> 00:49:44,503
My father said ,

500
00:49:44,579 --> 00:49:47,446
" Mother tells me you 're sorry . "

501
00:49:48,249 --> 00:49:52,208
I said , " Yes , please forgive me . "

502
00:49:53,421 --> 00:49:56,652
" Prepare the divan , then , " he said .

503
00:49:57,592 --> 00:50:00,561
I went to the green divan in my father 's room ,

504
00:50:00,628 --> 00:50:06,066
took some cushions , and stacked them .

505
00:50:07,168 --> 00:50:10,604
Then I fetched the cane , unbuttoned my trousers ,

506
00:50:10,672 --> 00:50:13,072
and leaned forward onto the cushions .

507
00:50:14,976 --> 00:50:19,913
He said , " So how many strokes do you deserve ? "

508
00:50:21,516 --> 00:50:24,952
And I answered , " As many strokes as possible . "

509
00:50:26,521 --> 00:50:28,887
And he struck me with the cane ,

510
00:50:28,957 --> 00:50:30,857
hard enough

511
00:50:30,925 --> 00:50:32,916
but not more than I could bear .

512
00:50:36,764 --> 00:50:38,755
When the caning was over ,

513
00:50:38,833 --> 00:50:42,496
I went to Mother and asked ,

514
00:50:42,570 --> 00:50:44,697
" Mother , can you forgive me now ? "

515
00:50:45,540 --> 00:50:50,341
And she cried and said , " Of course I forgive you . "

516
00:50:53,348 --> 00:50:55,373
Then she offered me her hand .

517
00:50:57,385 --> 00:50:58,909
I kissed it .

518
00:51:09,130 --> 00:51:12,099
Alma , are you listening ?

519
00:51:12,166 --> 00:51:13,565
Are you asleep ?

520
00:51:13,635 --> 00:51:15,330
No , I 'm awake .

521
00:51:17,205 --> 00:51:19,070
My back aches .

522
00:51:21,743 --> 00:51:24,268
To think it 's pitch black out still .

523
00:51:26,447 --> 00:51:28,278
And so quiet ...

524
00:51:29,717 --> 00:51:32,982
Strange , how the sea is never still .

525
00:51:33,788 --> 00:51:37,246
Frightening somehow .

526
00:51:37,825 --> 00:51:40,658
- Are you crying ? - No , I 'm not crying .

527
00:51:42,497 --> 00:51:45,193
I 'm thinking of the child

528
00:51:45,266 --> 00:51:48,133
and this great , quiet darkness .

529
00:51:49,070 --> 00:51:51,766
Maybe it will never get light again .

530
00:51:52,707 --> 00:51:54,698
Poor dear .

531
00:51:54,776 --> 00:51:57,370
Give me your hand .

532
00:52:00,214 --> 00:52:02,148
That 's much better .

533
00:52:07,488 --> 00:52:10,651
Remember that day I said I 'd been snake bitten ?

534
00:52:11,592 --> 00:52:12,923
Yes .

535
00:52:15,296 --> 00:52:16,923
It wasn 't a snakebite .

536
00:52:18,399 --> 00:52:20,026
Not a snakebite ?

537
00:52:23,004 --> 00:52:26,303
I thought I 'd never tell a soul . I don 't even know if ...

538
00:52:27,342 --> 00:52:29,333
You have to tell me !

539
00:52:29,944 --> 00:52:31,935
You must never tell anyone else .

540
00:52:32,013 --> 00:52:35,847
No , I promise , I 'll never tell anyone .

541
00:52:36,417 --> 00:52:40,410
Remember that place by the cliffs ? We were there early this summer .

542
00:52:40,488 --> 00:52:41,638
Yes .

543
00:59:06,273 --> 00:59:08,264
Is the door locked securely ?

544
00:59:08,342 --> 00:59:10,207
I checked twice .

545
00:59:21,255 --> 00:59:22,415
Good morning !

546
00:59:22,490 --> 00:59:25,254
Forgive my intrusion . A thousand pardons .

547
00:59:26,093 --> 00:59:30,029
Looks like a storm coming ! I thought I 'd stop in for a moment .

548
00:59:30,865 --> 00:59:32,924
I do also have an errand .

549
00:59:34,168 --> 00:59:37,228
May I sit down ? This won 't take long .

550
00:59:41,308 --> 00:59:43,401
I am to convey an invitation from the castle .

551
00:59:43,477 --> 00:59:47,641
We had thought a little party ... No , not a big gathering .

552
00:59:47,715 --> 00:59:50,013
Just something to distract those poor people

553
00:59:50,084 --> 00:59:52,746
stuck in the castle year round , gnawing on each other !

554
00:59:52,820 --> 00:59:55,584
As I said , not a large party .

555
00:59:56,290 --> 01:00:00,989
But it will interest you that Veronica Vogler will be there .

556
01:00:01,061 --> 01:00:05,225
And you will come too , yes ?

557
01:00:05,966 --> 01:00:07,524
All right , then it 's agreed .

558
01:00:09,637 --> 01:00:12,470
Incidentally , Von Merkens and I discussed the other day

559
01:00:12,540 --> 01:00:14,531
your possible need to defend yourself .

560
01:00:14,608 --> 01:00:17,668
I mean , from all the small game on the island .

561
01:00:20,247 --> 01:00:23,444
That is all for the moment . Good morning , dear friends .

562
01:00:23,517 --> 01:00:25,610
Hope to see you at our little party .

563
01:00:31,792 --> 01:00:34,158
Shouldn 't you lock that weapon away ?

564
01:00:34,228 --> 01:00:35,559
No , why ?

565
01:00:39,867 --> 01:00:41,858
And what do we do now ?

566
01:00:43,704 --> 01:00:46,172
You can tell me about Veronica Vogler .

567
01:00:51,245 --> 01:00:53,475
What do you want me to say ?

568
01:00:53,547 --> 01:00:55,742
That it went on for five years ?

569
01:00:55,816 --> 01:00:57,306
You know that already .

570
01:00:57,384 --> 01:00:59,614
We were discovered . It was a huge scandal .

571
01:00:59,687 --> 01:01:03,123
The story was quieted down ... and then it ended .

572
01:01:03,190 --> 01:01:06,125
That 's not what it says in your diary .

573
01:01:13,534 --> 01:01:17,368
" My attachment to Veronica finally was painful for us both .

574
01:01:17,438 --> 01:01:21,670
" I followed her in the streets , jealously spied on her .

575
01:01:21,742 --> 01:01:24,540
" I believe my passion stimulated her ,

576
01:01:24,612 --> 01:01:27,172
" but she was always passive and indecisive .

577
01:01:27,248 --> 01:01:30,775
" We often ended in frightening confrontations

578
01:01:30,851 --> 01:01:32,842
" far from any semblance of reason .

579
01:01:32,920 --> 01:01:37,323
We traveled from town to town evading relatives or lawyers . "

580
01:01:39,426 --> 01:01:40,576
No !

581
01:01:44,465 --> 01:01:46,558
" We incarnated the words of the Bible ,

582
01:01:46,634 --> 01:01:50,297
that man and woman shall be of one flesh . "

583
01:01:51,572 --> 01:01:54,006
" Then her husband came and fetched her .

584
01:01:54,074 --> 01:01:56,201
" I was sent to the hospital .

585
01:01:56,277 --> 01:01:58,768
We did not see each other for several years . "

586
01:02:05,486 --> 01:02:09,650
You said once that what you liked about me

587
01:02:09,723 --> 01:02:14,023
was that God had made me in one piece ...

588
01:02:18,432 --> 01:02:21,924
that I had whole feelings and whole thoughts .

589
01:02:24,004 --> 01:02:27,997
You said it was important that there were people like me .

590
01:02:31,111 --> 01:02:33,341
It sounded so lovely .

591
01:02:34,748 --> 01:02:36,739
It made me so happy .

592
01:02:38,919 --> 01:02:40,682
I was wrong .

593
01:02:43,257 --> 01:02:44,918
I don 't understand a thing .

594
01:02:49,997 --> 01:02:52,090
I don 't understand you !

595
01:02:52,967 --> 01:02:54,958
You 're nothing but frightened !

596
01:02:56,704 --> 01:03:01,107
And you want to stay here and possibly be killed !

597
01:03:02,609 --> 01:03:05,908
Do you think I want to see you run after that woman ,

598
01:03:05,980 --> 01:03:08,949
talking to those ghosts , guarding myself all the time ?

599
01:03:09,016 --> 01:03:10,813
Do you think I want that ?

600
01:03:13,754 --> 01:03:15,244
But I 'll stay .

601
01:04:03,570 --> 01:04:05,663
Get up from the table now .

602
01:04:16,050 --> 01:04:17,711
Now walk towards the door .

603
01:04:21,422 --> 01:04:23,083
Now walk through it .

604
01:04:23,891 --> 01:04:25,654
You go down the steps .

605
01:04:25,726 --> 01:04:28,126
It 's not dark anymore . You can find your way .

606
01:04:55,089 --> 01:04:59,719
How delightful ! Welcome !

607
01:04:59,793 --> 01:05:03,388
Carry the tray , please .

608
01:05:03,464 --> 01:05:06,865
Thank you . It 's my supper , you see .

609
01:05:07,601 --> 01:05:11,128
Old Lindhorst , who is worldly , says that old harlots

610
01:05:11,205 --> 01:05:15,369
have an unhealthy desire to fill their mouths and stomachs .

611
01:05:17,211 --> 01:05:19,202
You really don 't care for anything ?

612
01:05:19,279 --> 01:05:21,270
Wasn 't there to be a party here this evening ?

613
01:05:21,849 --> 01:05:23,578
Not as far as I know .

614
01:05:25,552 --> 01:05:28,851
No , don 't leave !

615
01:05:31,425 --> 01:05:33,723
Please help me off with my stockings .

616
01:05:36,563 --> 01:05:38,827
You don 't like to touch me .

617
01:05:39,466 --> 01:05:41,696
I sense it clearly .

618
01:05:42,336 --> 01:05:44,236
I don 't understand .

619
01:05:45,706 --> 01:05:48,300
Veronica Vogler has come ...

620
01:05:50,043 --> 01:05:52,807
and I 'm the only one who can tell you where she is .

621
01:05:55,015 --> 01:05:57,984
Look closely at my feet , Artist .

622
01:05:58,318 --> 01:06:02,379
Have you seen younger , tighter arches ?

623
01:06:02,456 --> 01:06:04,947
Look closely . Look at my heel ,

624
01:06:05,025 --> 01:06:07,653
how smooth and fine it is .

625
01:06:07,728 --> 01:06:11,994
Such strong toes and beautiful nails .

626
01:06:12,065 --> 01:06:13,760
Kiss my foot .

627
01:06:13,834 --> 01:06:15,995
Yes , go ahead .

628
01:06:16,737 --> 01:06:18,602
Yes , there !

629
01:06:19,573 --> 01:06:21,632
You 've been sweet ,

630
01:06:21,708 --> 01:06:25,269
and I 'll tell you where she is .

631
01:06:28,782 --> 01:06:31,615
Try the west gallery .

632
01:06:31,685 --> 01:06:35,143
She was there five minutes ago .

633
01:07:09,790 --> 01:07:13,123
- Pardon me , I thought ... - You 're always welcome , dear friend .

634
01:07:13,193 --> 01:07:16,754
You come , you go , you stay . You have complete freedom .

635
01:07:17,598 --> 01:07:20,123
Let us speak openly as well .

636
01:07:20,200 --> 01:07:22,532
You have come to find Veronica Vogler .

637
01:07:23,770 --> 01:07:25,761
I should perhaps mention before you see her

638
01:07:25,839 --> 01:07:29,070
that Veronica has been my mistress for several years .

639
01:07:29,910 --> 01:07:34,347
She has kindly related in detail your common past .

640
01:07:35,549 --> 01:07:37,642
I can assure you I suffer .

641
01:07:39,152 --> 01:07:41,143
I shall be by your bed tonight .

642
01:07:42,289 --> 01:07:44,951
Every word , every kiss , every movement across your bodies ...

643
01:07:45,025 --> 01:07:47,357
Nothing will be spared me .

644
01:07:48,262 --> 01:07:50,025
Come , I 'll show the way .

645
01:08:31,805 --> 01:08:35,434
Oh , it 's only my jealousy . Please go away .

646
01:08:36,043 --> 01:08:40,412
Yes , of course . Of course .

647
01:09:34,101 --> 01:09:36,968
It 's Conductor Kreisler playing .

648
01:09:39,906 --> 01:09:44,468
Conductor Kreisler is a master at his instrument .

649
01:09:49,049 --> 01:09:52,712
Don 't you think Veronica has waited long enough ?

650
01:09:52,786 --> 01:09:56,586
She began preparing for your visit already this morning .

651
01:09:58,759 --> 01:10:00,784
She has become even more beautiful .

652
01:10:01,828 --> 01:10:03,819
My husband is suffering .

653
01:10:03,897 --> 01:10:05,660
He is jealous .

654
01:10:07,567 --> 01:10:10,331
And your touching little companion ...

655
01:10:10,670 --> 01:10:13,867
Three shots , one of them fatal .

656
01:10:15,375 --> 01:10:18,708
Wonderful music .

657
01:10:19,880 --> 01:10:24,544
I think I must take off my hat so I can hear better .

658
01:10:44,137 --> 01:10:46,367
It really smells of glue !

659
01:10:46,440 --> 01:10:49,500
Though she insists it is all synthetic .

660
01:10:49,576 --> 01:10:53,137
Plain old glue is what it is . She can 't fool me .

661
01:11:18,738 --> 01:11:20,797
We have our tricks , don 't we ?

662
01:11:20,874 --> 01:11:23,968
Let 's see now if we 're presentable .

663
01:11:24,044 --> 01:11:27,707
How pale you are , dear friend . What a sight !

664
01:11:27,781 --> 01:11:30,113
Your lips are as blue as if you 'd eaten blueberries .

665
01:11:30,183 --> 01:11:32,208
We must do something . Sit down here .

666
01:11:33,220 --> 01:11:37,179
Let 's see what we can do .

667
01:11:38,425 --> 01:11:39,575
Right .

668
01:11:42,229 --> 01:11:44,527
A lovely cupid 's bow ...

669
01:11:46,199 --> 01:11:50,829
A sensual lower lip is always titillating .

670
01:11:52,072 --> 01:11:54,063
Your eyes are swollen and bloodshot .

671
01:11:54,140 --> 01:11:56,540
This will soothe them .

672
01:12:04,351 --> 01:12:06,182
Well , dear me .

673
01:12:06,820 --> 01:12:11,450
And so , a few lines on the eyelids .

674
01:12:12,726 --> 01:12:14,193
There now !

675
01:12:17,964 --> 01:12:21,331
Some fresh color to your skin wouldn 't hurt .

676
01:12:28,041 --> 01:12:32,876
Well , what next ? Yes , borrow my robe .

677
01:12:36,283 --> 01:12:40,617
There and there ... and there .

678
01:12:40,687 --> 01:12:43,884
And see there . It suits you , it suits you !

679
01:12:44,224 --> 01:12:48,661
Wait , beautiful pajamas are called for on occasions such as this .

680
01:12:51,565 --> 01:12:53,965
A nice perfume ? No ?

681
01:12:54,034 --> 01:12:56,502
You prefer to smell of yourself , of course .

682
01:12:56,570 --> 01:12:58,970
Each to his own scent , but a little ...

683
01:12:59,039 --> 01:13:00,563
gives a scent anyway .

684
01:13:00,640 --> 01:13:02,608
I knew it .

685
01:13:02,676 --> 01:13:04,667
See yourself now in the mirror .

686
01:13:07,681 --> 01:13:10,013
Now you are yourself

687
01:13:10,083 --> 01:13:12,347
and yet not yourself ,

688
01:13:12,419 --> 01:13:16,082
the ideal state for a meeting between lovers .

689
01:13:17,424 --> 01:13:19,756
Come now ! This way !

690
01:13:43,516 --> 01:13:45,006
There is her door .

691
01:13:51,524 --> 01:13:53,424
You see what you want to see !

692
01:16:43,663 --> 01:16:45,426
Veronica , no !

693
01:17:07,887 --> 01:17:12,551
No , them ... Don 't pay attention to them !

694
01:18:16,956 --> 01:18:18,514
I thank you ...

695
01:18:20,960 --> 01:18:24,054
that the limit has finally been transgressed .

696
01:18:26,299 --> 01:18:28,324
The mirror has been shattered .

697
01:18:31,037 --> 01:18:33,130
But what do the splinters reflect ?

698
01:18:36,242 --> 01:18:37,903
Can you tell me that ?

699
01:19:29,195 --> 01:19:31,186
Yes , he fired three shots .

700
01:19:31,931 --> 01:19:35,867
One scratched my arm . I still have a little scar .

701
01:19:37,370 --> 01:19:39,998
I fell over from sheer terror .

702
01:19:40,073 --> 01:19:42,473
I thought it best to lie still .

703
01:19:43,910 --> 01:19:47,346
I heard him pace back and forth , behind and around the house ...

704
01:19:48,114 --> 01:19:50,639
then he ran toward the path .

705
01:19:51,217 --> 01:19:53,048
I stood up , went inside ,

706
01:19:53,119 --> 01:19:56,020
washed off the blood , and put on a bandage .

707
01:19:56,823 --> 01:19:59,383
Then I hid the pistol and sat down to wait .

708
01:20:01,527 --> 01:20:05,827
He was gone some minutes , then he came running back .

709
01:20:07,600 --> 01:20:09,659
I hid myself to be on the safe side .

710
01:20:10,403 --> 01:20:12,462
He looked absolutely insane .

711
01:20:13,272 --> 01:20:16,730
He walked around the cottage talking to himself ...

712
01:20:18,444 --> 01:20:21,311
then he got out the diary and began to write .

713
01:20:21,948 --> 01:20:23,882
He wrote for hours .

714
01:20:25,985 --> 01:20:28,681
Then by mid-morning he packed his satchel

715
01:20:28,755 --> 01:20:30,985
and headed off toward the woods .

716
01:20:32,325 --> 01:20:34,623
I thought it best to follow him .

717
01:20:35,294 --> 01:20:36,955
He might harm himself .

718
01:21:22,375 --> 01:21:24,002
Don 't you see me ?

719
01:22:33,546 --> 01:22:36,515
- Where is he ? - I know where you can find him .

720
01:22:36,582 --> 01:22:37,732
Come .

721
01:22:40,186 --> 01:22:41,813
Call to him , then .

722
01:25:11,370 --> 01:25:14,237
Well , there is one thing I 've wondered .

723
01:25:15,041 --> 01:25:17,100
Are you in a hurry ?

724
01:25:17,176 --> 01:25:19,542
I 'd like to ask you something .

725
01:25:20,546 --> 01:25:21,945
It 's like this .

726
01:25:23,649 --> 01:25:28,245
Isn 't it true that when a woman has lived a long time with a man ...

727
01:25:29,221 --> 01:25:32,315
isn 't it true she finally becomes like that man ?

728
01:25:33,659 --> 01:25:36,184
Since she loves him

729
01:25:36,262 --> 01:25:38,492
and tries to think like him

730
01:25:38,564 --> 01:25:40,327
and see like him .

731
01:25:41,167 --> 01:25:43,658
They say that it can change a person .

732
01:25:46,972 --> 01:25:49,964
Was that why I began to see those ghosts ?

733
01:25:51,544 --> 01:25:53,535
Or were they there anyway ?

734
01:25:56,582 --> 01:26:00,575
I mean , if I 'd loved him less

735
01:26:00,653 --> 01:26:03,952
and not bothered about everything there around him ...

736
01:26:05,224 --> 01:26:07,624
could I have protected him better then ?

737
01:26:11,197 --> 01:26:15,463
Or was it that I didn 't love him enough

738
01:26:15,534 --> 01:26:17,866
that made me so jealous ?

739
01:26:19,972 --> 01:26:24,807
Was that why those " cannibals , " as he called them ...

740
01:26:26,445 --> 01:26:29,175
was that why we came to such grief ?

741
01:26:37,289 --> 01:26:39,883
I thought I was so close to him .

742
01:26:43,229 --> 01:26:45,959
Sometimes he said he was also close to me .

743
01:26:48,467 --> 01:26:50,628
One time he said it with certainty .

744
01:26:54,874 --> 01:26:58,071
If only I could have followed him , all the time .

745
01:27:01,981 --> 01:27:04,176
There 's so much to keep pondering ...

746
01:27:06,018 --> 01:27:10,011
so many questions , sometimes I don 't know which way is which ,

747
01:27:10,089 --> 01:27:12,114
and I get completely ...

